itemGroup.buzzybeesbackport=Buzzy Bees Backport
config.buzzybeesbackport.honey=Honey
config.buzzybeesbackport.honey.tooltip=Honey bottles, honeycomb, honey blocks and honeycomb blocks.
config.buzzybeesbackport.honey.enabled=Enabled
config.buzzybeesbackport.honey.enabled.tooltip=Honey bottles, honeycomb, honey blocks and honeycomb blocks. Off, nothing is registered.
config.buzzybeesbackport.bees=Bees
config.buzzybeesbackport.bees.tooltip=Bees, bee nests and beehives.
config.buzzybeesbackport.bees.enabled=Enabled
config.buzzybeesbackport.bees.enabled.tooltip=Bees, bee nests and beehives. Off, nothing is registered.
config.buzzybeesbackport.nests=Nest Generation
config.buzzybeesbackport.nests.tooltip=Bee nests generating on trees and growing with saplings near flowers.
config.buzzybeesbackport.nests.enabled=Enabled
config.buzzybeesbackport.nests.enabled.tooltip=Bee nests generate on oak and birch trees in newly generated chunks, and sometimes grow with saplings near flowers.
config.buzzybeesbackport.nests.moddedBiomes=Nests in Other Mods' Biomes
config.buzzybeesbackport.nests.moddedBiomes.tooltip=Other mods' biomes get nests too, by their Forge biome types: plains like plains (5% of trees), broadleaf forests like forests (0.2%).
config.buzzybeesbackport.golems=Iron Golems
config.buzzybeesbackport.golems.tooltip=Iron golems cracking as they are hurt, and repairing them with iron ingots.
config.buzzybeesbackport.golems.enabled=Enabled
config.buzzybeesbackport.golems.enabled.tooltip=Iron golems show cracks as they lose health and can be repaired with iron ingots.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks=Other 1.15 Changes
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.tooltip=1.15's smaller changes, each with its own switch.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.enabled=Enabled
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.enabled.tooltip=1.15's smaller changes. Off, none of them apply, whatever their own switches say.
config.buzzybeesbackport.compat=Compatibility
config.buzzybeesbackport.compat.tooltip=Worlds and blocks from other mods that add the same things.
config.buzzybeesbackport.compat.convertRemoved=Convert Removed Mod's Content
config.buzzybeesbackport.compat.convertRemoved.tooltip=Convert blocks, items and bees left behind by another mod that added them, when that mod is removed from a world.
tooltip.buzzybeesbackport.beehive.bees=Bees: %s / %s
tooltip.buzzybeesbackport.beehive.honey=Honey: %s / %s
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.endStoneBricks=End Stone Bricks Hardness
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.endStoneBricks.tooltip=End stone bricks take as long to mine as stone (hardness 3) and resist explosions like it (9).
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.boatFuel=Boats as Fuel
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.boatFuel.tooltip=A boat burns long enough to smelt 6 items.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.spongeDries=Sponges Dry in the Nether
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.spongeDries.tooltip=A wet sponge placed in the Nether dries at once.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.railFacing=Rails Face the Player
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.railFacing.tooltip=A rail with nothing to connect to is placed along the way you are facing.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.fernSeeds=Large Ferns Drop Seeds
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.fernSeeds.tooltip=Large ferns drop wheat seeds like tall grass.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.spawnEggBabies=Spawn Eggs Make Baby Zombies
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.spawnEggBabies.tooltip=Using a spawn egg on an adult zombie, husk, zombie villager, zombie pigman or drowned of its kind spawns a baby.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.babyAnimals=Babies in Animal Groups
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.babyAnimals.tooltip=Animals spawning in groups are sometimes babies: 5% for cows, sheep, pigs, chickens and foxes, 10% for wolves, horses and llamas.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.parrotImitation=Parrots Imitate Fewer Mobs
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.parrotImitation.tooltip=Parrots no longer imitate endermen, polar bears, wolves or zombie pigmen.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.creativeEating=Eat in Creative
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.creativeEating.tooltip=Food and cake can be eaten in Creative mode.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.bedSpawn=Beds Set Spawn on Use
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.bedSpawn.tooltip=Using a bed sets your respawn point and says so, even when it is too early to sleep.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.gameRules=1.15 Game Rules
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.gameRules.tooltip=Adds the game rules fallDamage, fireDamage, drowningDamage, doImmediateRespawn and doInsomnia.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.dispensers=Dispenser Changes
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.dispensers.tooltip=Dispensers fill glass bottles from water, place armor stands and light campfires with fire charges.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.bellRedstone=Bells Ring on Redstone
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.bellRedstone.tooltip=A bell rings when it is powered by redstone.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.splashTexts=1.15 Splash Texts
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.splashTexts.tooltip=The title screen can show 1.15's three new splash texts.
